  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingAmountOfContractLiabilitiesTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_NonConsolidatedMember">&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:36.8pt;text-indent:-13.5pt;"&gt;※３　固定負債のその他に含まれる契約負債の残高は、次のとおりであります。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_unitR" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:369pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:3pt;font-size:3pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="margin-left:25pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;border:solid 0pt #000000;width:437.5pt;table-layout:fixed;"&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style="width:145.5pt;min-width:145.5pt;"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width:146pt;min-width:146pt;"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width:146pt;min-width:146pt;"/&gt;
